  },
  "model": "WM15",
  "kind": "power-meter",
  "title": {
    "ko": "카를로 가바치 WM15 패널형 전력 분석계 (RS485 Modbus RTU)",
    "en": "Carlo Gavazzi WM15 panel power analyzer (RS485 Modbus RTU)"
  },
  "summary": {
    "ko": "96×96 패널 계측기. 계측값 INT32(워드 하위 먼저)·배율(V×10, A×1000, W×10, kWh×10). FC 03·04 같은 결과, 설정은 06·10.",
    "en": "96x96 panel meter. Measurements INT32 (low word first) with weights (V×10, A×1000, W×10, kWh×10). FC 03 and 04 give the same result; settings via 06 and 10."
  },
  "protocols": [
    "rtu"
  ],
  "comm": {
    "baud": 9600,
    "bauds": [
      9600,
      19200,
      38400,
      57600,
      115200
    ],
    "dataBits": 8,
    "parity": "none",
    "stopBits": 1,
    "unit": 1,
    "unitRange": [
      1,
      247
    ],
    "order": "CDAB",
    "maxRegisters": 125,
    "addressing": "plc",
    "notes": [
      {
        "ko": "매뉴얼은 «Modicom address»(300001 꼴)와 «Physical address»(프레임에 넣는 워드 주소, 0000h 꼴)를 함께 적는다 (p.4). address 는 Physical address(= Modicom − 300001).",
        "en": "The manual gives both the 'Modicom address' (300001 style) and the 'Physical address' (word address in the frame, 0000h style) (p.4). address is the physical address (= Modicom − 300001)."
      },
      {
        "ko": "FC 03·04 같은 결과, 한 번에 125워드까지 읽기, 06·10(123워드까지) 쓰기 (p.4~6). 출하 국번 1·9600 bps·패리티 없음·정지 1비트 (p.18).",
        "en": "FC 03 and 04 give the same result, up to 125 words per read; writes with 06 and 10 (up to 123 words) (pp.4-6). Defaults: address 1, 9600 bps, no parity, 1 stop bit (p.18)."
      },
      {
        "ko": "INT32 는 워드 하위 먼저(LSW→MSW) (p.8) → CDAB.",
        "en": "INT32: words LSW→MSW (p.8) → CDAB."
      }
    ]
  },
